# Wayboxd Domain

Read `docs/agent/domain-map.md` for the full map.

## Quick reference

**Auth track:** `User` → NextAuth credentials → JWT session

**Public API:** `src/app/api/(controller)/public/` (no session required)

**Protected API:** all other routes under `src/app/api/(controller)/` (session required via `src/proxy.ts`)

## Current models

| Model | Table   | Notes                          |
| ----- | ------- | ------------------------------ |
| User  | `users` | email unique, bcrypt password  |

## API prefixes

| Prefix | Audience        |
| ------ | --------------- |
| `public/` | Unauthenticated |
| `auth/`   | NextAuth        |
| other     | Authenticated   |
